# API keys are entered directly in the UI and stored in localStorage.
# No server-side secrets needed — all calls are made directly from the browser.
#
# If you'd like to pre-populate keys for local dev, you can set them here
# and read them via import.meta.env, but the UI input is the primary method.

# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# VITE_GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=AIza...
# VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
